  StyleBox["tolerance", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "57a441d3-f100-d240-b724-3b5d7bc62d83"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData["0.00001"], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c2d355b5-9653-f040-860a-2f2d8825ad13"],
 "; the first matching branch wins."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->676272485,ExpressionUUID->"77597d40-6eaa-7a4d-9e72-2c1f6c508a55"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "If no branch matches, returns a zero array of the first matrix shape. ",
